3.0.0
2026-05-26
track-changes v3 — two-skill split + leaner always-on footprint.
The single v2 skill is decomposed into two: a narrowed always-on `track-changes`
  mark-gate and a NEW opt-in `verified-import` skill (`/import`) for inserting a
  vetted source into a tracked document. The skills share one tc_core package
  (track-changes/lib/tc_core — not duplicated); verified-import imports it.
- SessionStart now injects a compact reference/digest.md (~2.9 KB) instead of the
  full SKILL.md — ~93.5% smaller, well under the 40 KB inline cap; full SKILL.md is
  lazy-loaded on demand via "see SKILL.md §N" pointers.
- Always-on surface narrowed (idea.md scope-decomposition thrust): §0 import wrappers
  moved out to verified-import (convert-on-import faithfulness, fail-closed); §5
  cross-file mark renumbering removed; §6 edit-inside-non-rendering-construct sibling
  removed (such edits now route to /draft). Brand-new-block sibling (mechanism-1,
  md/qmd) is kept; a brand-new LaTeX \section/env routes to /draft.
- Persistent daemon DROPPED after measurement (in-process pre_tool_use p50 ~41.5 ms,
  ~6x under the keep threshold; the daemon's ~13.5 ms/edit saving did not justify a
  294-line localhost-TCP subsystem). In-process is now the sole hook path.
- /import stages a target-keyed pending-import, verifies the AI-converted block is
  content-faithful to the named source (markup-agnostic content-word compare), and on
  pass writes a one-shot exemption sentinel that the track-changes gate consumes — a
  verified import lands clean (no marks); a discrepancy blocks fail-closed.
- Mechanical fixes #4–#7: /tc resolution + status default to the most-recently-modified
  tracked working file (echoed); bare /tc prints the compact menu; resolving a
  whole-line mark to empty drops the orphaned blank line; utcnow() deprecation removed.
- Clean break (Q2): the v3 mark grammar is UNCHANGED — existing tracked documents need
  NO conversion; upgrading from v2 only re-installs files and replaces the single v2
  hook registration with the v3 two-skill set (verified-import before track-changes on
  PreToolUse). /tc migrate (v1→v2 marks) is retained for legacy v1 marks.
- 325-test v3 suite (A–V) green.
